T exemption"}, {"id": "c5df0bf3-e524-4d26-9a7d-c8f6aa5b9f69", "type": "concept", "title": "AMT credit overview"}], "description": "AMT is a parallel system meant to limit the effect of certain preferences."}, {"id": "4b25ec92-b218-42d7-928e-ee1b2b5f1bbd", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Net investment income tax", "children": [{"id": "1fd3287f-dffe-4602-a143-f6e4142f7ca8", "type": "concept", "title": "Net investment income"}, {"id": "bb772bdd-fb2e-4263-92e8-b3f026dc3a4d", "type": "concept", "title": "Modified AGI"}, {"id": "ad21844e-0b91-4ab9-9af7-00859d7d705d", "type": "concept", "title": "Threshold concept"}, {"id": "5482dbb5-68cb-428f-9dcc-8d8061a73652", "type": "concept", "title": "Investment-income categories"}], "description": "NIIT can apply to higher-income taxpayers with investment income."}, {"id": "0f15e0bd-9d87-4f94-815a-36b55845b2f0", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Other add-on taxes and limits", "children": [{"id": "4f75a9e6-e3c7-4b29-bc63-606c9cb5fcfd", "type": "concept", "title": "Additional Medicare tax"}, {"id": "b57698e0-1401-4afa-b140-dcd30f2a4777", "type": "concept", "title": "Early distribution penalties"}, {"id": "d8b3f7ef-69be-4508-b7a8-0a902e9b5ad9", "type": "concept", "title": "Credit phaseouts"}, {"id": "60dd85fa-1463-4fd6-a857-0a70b5e1630b", "type": "concept", "title": "Limitation awareness"}], "description": "Some taxes and limitations sit outside the basic tax-table calculation."}]}, {"id": "c5d32bd3-be12-4dc1-bc83-20242d385f61", "type": "topic", "title": "Tax Compliance, IRS Procedure, Notices, Amendments, and Documentation", "description": "Understand the practical workflow of preparing, documenting, reviewing, filing, and responding to tax matters.", "children": [{"id": "f212b546-6273-4e20-924b-8e3946f48a71", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Return preparation workflow", "children": [{"id": "819d4208-293d-4c3a-83b7-bb53db2d65a1", "type": "concept", "title": "Client intake"}, {"id": "6363d58e-9db4-4053-9f60-485c6bfd6fe5", "type": "concept",